---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ENGINEERING_PILOT, ANALYTICS_EVENTS } from '../../../data/site.js';
---
<Layout title={`Capability brief | ${ENGINEERING_PILOT.name}`} description={ENGINEERING_PILOT.description} hideFooterNewsletter={true}>
<article class="brief wrap">
<header><div class="identity"><strong>COLLIN WILKINS</strong><span>AI-assisted delivery systems for engineering teams</span><a href="/">collinwilkins.com</a></div><h1>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.lead}</h1><p class="lead">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.outcome}</p><div class="actions"><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.bookingPageOpen} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallLabel}</a><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.pilotCtaClick} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeLabel}</a><a class="pdf" href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.capabilityBriefPdfHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.capabilityBriefDownload} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">Download PDF</a></div></header>
<div class="grid"><section><h2>The fixed contract</h2><p class="contract"><strong>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.priceLabel}</strong> · {ENGINEERING_PILOT.deliveryWindow} · {ENGINEERING_PILOT.deliveryMode}</p><p>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.scope} The customer owns the adapted files after handoff.</p><h3>Installed assets</h3><ul><li>Structured issue intake and repository-specific <code>AGENTS.md</code></li><li>Protected paths and one configured coding-agent adapter</li><li>Existing CI hook, model config, and normalized usage evidence</li><li>Five smoke cases and a customer-owned handoff guide</li></ul><h3>Acceptance criteria</h3><ol>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.acceptance.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ol></section>
<section><h2>Readiness gate</h2><p class="qualifier">The five-day clock starts only after every condition is ready.</p><ul>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.readiness.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul><h3>Payment and risk reversal</h3><p>$500 follows written scope acceptance. The $1,000 balance is due only after every agreed acceptance criterion passes.</p><p>If a ready environment misses acceptance on business day five, I correct the agreed in-scope installation at no additional charge until the criteria pass. Customer delays pause the clock; changes and pre-existing failures are re-scoped.</p><h3>Founding-price boundary</h3><p>The $1,500 price applies to the first three clients who accept written scope and pay $500. Accepted pilots keep that price; pricing is reviewed after the cohort.</p><h3>Qualified experience</h3><p class="qualifier">Full-time engineering outcomes, not consulting-client results.</p><p>42% fewer defects with approximately 20% shorter cycle time; systems handling 600K+ events/day; work associated with approximately $5M annual savings across 450K+ vehicles.</p><p class="brief-boundary"><strong>Working model:</strong> optional 30-minute fit call; one required 60-minute handoff; no kickoff or status meetings. Production credentials are not accepted.</p></section></div>
<footer class="close"><div><h2>One optional fit call. One required working handoff.</h2><p>No kickoff or status meetings by default. Repository access stays minimal; production credentials are not accepted. Client source and installed assets stay private. Calls are recorded for notes by default; clients can opt out before the session.</p></div><div class="actions"><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.bookingPageOpen} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-close">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallLabel}</a><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.pilotCtaClick} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-close">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeLabel}</a></div></footer>
</article>
</Layout>
<script define:vars={{ capabilityBriefView: ANALYTICS_EVENTS.capabilityBriefView }}>if(window.plausible)window.plausible(capabilityBriefView,{props:{location:'capability-brief-page'}});</script>
<style>
.brief{max-width:1000px;padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:70px}.identity{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;letter-spacing:.04em}.identity span{color:var(--ink-soft)}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,64px);line-height:1;margin:20px 0 14px}.lead{font-size:19px;line-height:1.45}.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;margin-top:15px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px;margin-top:32px;padding-top:25px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 8px}h3{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:16px 0 6px}p,li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:6px 0}.contract,.path,.qualifier{font-size:13px}.qualifier{font-style:italic}.close{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:24px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin-top:25px;padding-top:20px}.close h2{font-size:28px}.pdf{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:700px){.grid,.close{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pdf{margin-left:0}}@media print{@page{size:Letter;margin:.5in}:global(body){background:#fff!important;color:#000!important}.brief{padding:0;max-width:none}.brief :global(a){color:#000!important;text-decoration:underline}.brief :global(p),.brief :global(li){font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.18;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt}.brief :global(h1){font-size:25pt;line-height:1;margin:8pt 0 6pt}.brief :global(h2){font-size:14pt;line-height:1.05;margin:4pt 0}.brief :global(h3),.brief :global(.identity),.brief :global(.actions),.brief :global(.contract),.brief :global(.path),.brief :global(.qualifier){font-size:9.5pt;line-height:1.15}.brief :global(h3){margin:6pt 0 2pt}.brief :global(ul){margin:2pt 0;padding-left:14pt}.grid{gap:18pt;margin-top:12pt;padding-top:8pt}.actions{margin-top:7pt}.close{gap:14pt;margin-top:12pt;padding-top:8pt}.close h2{font-size:15pt}:global(nav),:global(body > footer),.pdf{display:none!important}}
@media print{.close{display:none!important}}
@media print{.grid{margin-top:8pt;padding-top:6pt}.brief :global(h1){margin:6pt 0 4pt}.actions{margin-top:5pt}}
</style>
